"""Runtime code copied in from other repos, pinned by source SHA256.

Vendored rather than imported so this repo runs standalone on the robot: the
excavator must not stop working because a sibling checkout moved, and the code
that drives the machine must not change under it when someone edits a
neighbouring project. Each file's header records where it came from, its source
SHA256, and the exact modifications applied. Re-sync by copying the file again,
re-applying the documented changes, and updating the sha.

Same convention as jetson-orin-nano-vla/bench/vendor/.
"""
